- [Elisabeth] That's so interesting.

00:08:54.604 --> 00:08:55.437
- Yeah, yeah, yeah.

00:08:55.437 --> 00:08:56.630
- I kind of like leading.

00:08:56.630 --> 00:08:57.622
- [Kelly] Nope, nope.

00:08:57.622 --> 00:08:58.455
(Elisabeth laughs)

00:08:58.455 --> 00:08:59.313
- [Kelly] But I have
to like, all the time.

00:08:59.313 --> 00:09:01.020
- You have to all the time,
that's what surprises me.

00:09:01.020 --> 00:09:02.473
- It drives me nuts.

00:09:02.473 --> 00:09:03.582
- But you're very good
at it, I would imagine.

00:09:03.582 --> 00:09:04.415
- You're very nice.

00:09:04.415 --> 00:09:05.260
- I mean, your show's successful.

00:09:05.260 --> 00:09:07.033
- Just a bunch of people behind
the scenes, making it work.

00:09:07.033 --> 00:09:08.203
- That is true though.

00:09:08.203 --> 00:09:09.036
- [Kelly] It is true.

00:09:09.036 --> 00:09:10.822
- It is true, like leading is kind of,

00:09:10.822 --> 00:09:12.673
