like, you know, with Brad.

00:09:18.931 --> 00:09:20.163
I don't feel like I'm leading him.

00:09:20.163 --> 00:09:21.672
I feel like we're partnering

00:09:21.672 --> 00:09:23.300
and that's the best place to be.

00:09:23.300 --> 00:09:24.923
- Maybe, that's the best
kind of leader, yes.

00:09:24.923 --> 00:09:25.756
- [Elisabeth] Ooh, well maybe.

00:09:25.756 --> 00:09:27.193
- Yes, nicely done.
(Kelly chuckles)

